WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
- We had Jacob Elordi here.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.060
I fell in love with him.

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.494
- [Cailee] I know, it's hard

00:00:04.494 --> 00:00:05.494
not to.
- [Kelly] He's so great.

00:00:05.494 --> 00:00:06.660
- He's so sweet.
- He's so sweet,

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.360
little Aussie boy, I was like,
"Oh my gosh, he's so sweet."

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.710
But one of the things that I-

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.390
first of all, how did y'all bond?

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.260
I'll ask that question first.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.060
Just 'cause y'all didn't know
each other before this, right?

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.310
So you're playing these
intimate, you know, roles, right?

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.750
- Well, sometimes you get onto set,

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.370
and it's okay to meet on day one as-

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.690
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- We roll right into it.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.631
But, you know, playing
Elvis and Priscilla,

00:00:23.631 --> 00:00:25.860
I knew that we had to
have that connection,

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.510
and had to have that trust in each other.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:29.610
So, when I found out he got the role,

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.470
I was so excited 'cause I loved his work,

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.600
but I didn't know how he was gonna be.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.580
So, I basically emailed him,

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.020
and forced him to hang out with me,

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.250
be friends with me.
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.200
- You will be my friend.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.690
- I was like, "Do you
wanna go horseback riding?"

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:45.420
Because that was something
Elvis and Priscilla loved to do,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.850
and he was so game and-
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:48.690
- [Cailee] Oh, yeah, that's us.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.191
- Oh, I've been there, that's on Sunset.

00:00:50.191 --> 00:00:51.024
I've done that.
- I know.

00:00:51.024 --> 00:00:52.860
And the Hollywood sign.
- Yes, I've been there.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:53.700
That's so awesome.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.290
But it's kind of hard to
have a conversation though.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.820
- Oh yeah, I know, it was so awkward.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.290
He's like behind me riding a horse.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:00.960
I'm like, "So what?

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.577
Are you close with your family?"

00:01:02.577 --> 00:01:03.810
(Kelly and audience laugh)

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.720
On this like group horseback riding trip,

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.280
no, he was so great,

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:11.730
and he was so, like,
connected with the the horse.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:14.130
Like, he's such a outback all like-

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:14.963
- [Kelly] Oh, like

00:01:14.963 --> 00:01:15.796
an animal guy?
- Yeah.

00:01:15.796 --> 00:01:16.629
- Yeah, no, I love him,

00:01:16.629 --> 00:01:18.900
and one of the things I loved
about him that we found out

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.550
is he's an amazing photographer,

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.560
and my favorite picture he took is of you,

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.580
I don't know if you've read your card yet,

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.320
but I was like, "I hope
you get a copy of it."

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:26.310
I have to show this picture.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:27.164
- [Cailee] Oh, I wanna see this.

00:01:27.164 --> 00:01:28.530
- Oh, this is not one I've seen.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:31.070
No, no, this is beautiful,
I've never seen that one.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:32.970
It was another one that we showed,

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.380
but anyway, we could show it.

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:35.213
Oh, I've never seen

00:01:35.213 --> 00:01:38.730
that one either.
(audience laughs and claps)

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:40.227
They gave us more.

00:01:40.227 --> 00:01:43.260
Oh my God, he's such a great photographer.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:44.250
- I know, that just was so special.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.980
- There's this one and you
look like a first lady.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:49.140
Like it's this one that they
showed whenever he was on.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:51.157
It's so beautiful, and I just was like,

00:01:51.157 --> 00:01:53.160
"I hope you get this picture.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.450
He should send this to you.

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:55.680
This should be your Christmas present."

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:56.910
- I just love that he did that,

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:59.430
because we shot the movie in 30 days,

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.770
so I sort of have amnesia
when I think back on it.

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:03.473
So it's so fun to see those photos

00:02:03.473 --> 00:02:06.047
and it was such a wild
journey we all went on.

00:02:06.047 --> 00:02:08.430
- That's a month.
- Yeah, to finish the,

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:09.263
I know.
(audience laughs)

00:02:09.263 --> 00:02:11.820
Only a month.
- I just got anxiety for you,

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:12.900
and it's already done.
(Cailee laughs)

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.457
I was like, "Wow, okay."

